{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261126/photo/bkn-20261126022539067-1126_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261126040519\"/><p>大老山隧道管道有3車相撞。</p><p>今日（26日）凌晨2時許，3輛私家車分序沿大老山隧道往沙田方向行駛，3車在管道內發生碰撞，其中兩輛私家車司機及一名乘客受傷，幸傷勢並不算嚴重。</p><p>警員到場向未有受傷司機進行酒精呼氣測試，但未能通過，被警員帶署再作「吹大機」。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T20:15:02.620683+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T18:25:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T21:49:36.156043+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T20:08:31.096745+00:00","content_hash":"59f48ec81353b516e489d912a74d8ff1c8f4b1777e1a3fa18ececfde73c42466","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}